note Exact cubin refusal diagnostics; strings are local stores because function-mode text pools are unavailable.
fn cmnum o edit uchar 256 p ulong v ulong b ulong to ulong
tmp = new uchar 24 0
n = omnum v b 0 tmp
for i ulong n
put o add p i get tmp i
end
ret add p n
end
